= 32.5 Hz, CH), 52.2 (CH3), -0.4 (CH3); 19F NMR (235 MHz, CDCl3) δ (ppm)
-78.2 (d, J = 6.5 Hz, 3F); IR (ATR) 2957, 2902, 1725, 1615, 1581, 1438,
1418 cm-1 ; HRMS (EI) calcd for [(C13H17F3O3Si)] 306.0899, found
306.0919.
