$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Bromodifluoromethylation of aldehydes (General
procedure). Lithium bromide (22 mg, 0.25 mmol for 4a-g,i-k; 131 mg, 1.5
mmol for 4h,l) was dried by heating with the heat gun (ca. 300 °C) under
vacuum of oil pump during 3 min, and the flask was cooled to room
temperature and filled with argon. Propionitrile (1 mL), Bu4NBr (177 mg,
0.55 mmol for 4ag, i-k; 483 mg, 1.5 mmol for 4h,l), aldehyde 2 (0.5
mmol), and silane 1a (305 mg, 1.5 mmol) were successively added, and the
reaction mixture was heated under gentle reflux (2 h for 4d,e; 5 h for
4a-c,f,g,i-k; 10 h for 4h,l). The dark brown mixture was cooled to room
temperature, trifluoroacetic acid (154 μL, 2 mmol for 4a-g,i-k; 308 μL, 4
mmol for 4h,l) and KHF2 (78 mg, 1 mmol for 4a-g,ik; 156 mg, 2 mmol for
4h,l) were added, and the mixture was stirred for 1 h at room
temperature. For the work-up, saturated aqueous Na2CO3 (1 mL) was added
dropwise followed by addition of water (5 mL), and the mixture was
extracted with methyl tert-butyl ether (3×3 mL). The combined organic
phases were filtered through Na2SO4, and concentrated under vacuum. The
residue was dissolved in small amount of hexane/EtOAc (2/1), passed
through short (1 cm) silica gel pad washing with 5 mL of hexane/EtOAc
(2/1). The solvent was evaporated, and the residue was purified by column
chromatography on silica gel. 2-Bromo-2,2-difluoro-1-phenylethanol (4a).
4 2-Bromo-2,2-difluoro-1-mesitylethanol (4h). Yield 117 mg (84%). White
crystalls. Mp 44–46 °C (hexanes). Chromatography hexanes/EtOAc 15 : 1 →
10 : 1. Rf 0.26 (hexanes/EtOAc 10 : 1). 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3), δ: 2.29
(s, 3H), 2.37–2.56 (br, 6H), 2.78 (d, 1H, J = 4.6), 5.59 (dt, 1H, J =
20.4, 4.4), 6.9 (s, 2H). 13C NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3), δ: 20.9, 21.2 (t, J =
3.2), 77.6 (dd, J = 22.1, 28.2), 125.5 (dd, J = 318.5, 310.7), 127.3,
130.2–131.2 (br), 138.3, 138.8. 19F NMR (282 MHz, CDCl3), δ: –56.5 (dd,
1F, J = 159.0, 20.4), –54.6 (dd, 1F, J = 159.0, 4.4). Calcd for
C11H13BrF2O (279.12): C, 47.33; H, 4.69. Found: C, 47.33; H, 4.84.
