$DATUM cis-3,3,3-Trifluoro-1,2-diphenylpropane-1,2-diol (1a) was prepared
according to the known procedure (Scheme 3).37 Addition of TMSCF3 (1.2
equiv) to benzil (1 equiv) gave the corresponding monosilyl-protected
ether intermediate, which on hydrolysis using TBAF produced the Diphenyl
keto alcohol in 83% yield. Rf = 0.73 (10:1 mixture of hexane and
EtOAc).38
