$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Using 3b: To a stirred solution of 1a (30.0
mg, 0.18 mmol), finely grounded 3b (15.0 mg, 0.018 mmol) and TMAF (1.6
mg, 0.018 mmol) in toluene/CH2Cl2 (2/1, 0.5 mL) Me3SiCF3 (52.2 μL, 0.35
mmol) was added at -80°C under N2 atmosphere. After the reaction mixture
was stirred for 6 h at the same temperature, it was quenched with sat.
NH4Cl aq. The aqueous layer was extracted with AcOEt (5 mL x 2), and the
combined organic layers were washed with brine, dried over MgSO4 and
concentrated under reduced pressure to furnish the crude 2a as a
trimethylsilyl ether. The trimethylsilyl ether was treated with TBAF
(50.6 mg, 0.19 mmol) in THF (1.5 mL) at room temperature for 1h. The
resulting mixture was concentrated under reduced pressure. The residue
was purified by column chromatography on silica gel (acetone/n-hexane=
10/1) to give 2a (36.9 mg, 87%, 85% ee) as a white solid
(E)-1,1,1-trifluoro-2-methyl-4-phenylbut-3-en-2-ol (2t) The reaction of
1t (29.2 mg, 0.20 mmol) with Me3SiCF3 (59.1 μL, 0.40 mmol) catalyzed by
TMAF (1.9 mg, 0.02 mmol) and 3b (17.1 mg, 0.02 mmol) in toluene/CH2Cl2
(2/1, 0.5 mL) gave 2t (36.7 mg, 85%, 70% ee) as colorless oil. 1H NMR
(CDCl3) δ 1.57 (s, 3H), 2.25 (br s, 1H), 6.29 (d, J = 16.2 Hz, 1H), 6.86
(d, J = 16.0 Hz, 1H), 7.26.7.43 (m, 5H); 19F NMR (CDCl3) δ .82.3 (s, 3F);
13C NMR (CDCl3, 50.3 MHz) δ 22.4, 74.0 (q, J =29.1 Hz), 125.3 (q, J =
284.1 Hz), 126.1, 126.6, 128.1, 128.5, 131.9, 135.4; IR (neat) 3400,
1496, 1449, 1382, 1293, 1259, 1164, 1095, 970, 748, 692 cm-1; MS (EI, m/z
) 216 (M+), 147; The ee of the product was determined by HPLC using an
AD-H column (n-hexane/i-PrOH = 95/5, flow rate 0.5 mL/min, λ = 254 nm,
τmaj =17.6 min, τmin = 19.5 min); [α]D 25= +25.7 (c = 0.59 , CHCl3), 70%
ee.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective, 70% ee
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Cinchona alkaloids/TMAF combination-catalyzed nucleophilic
enantioselective trifluoromethylation of aryl ketones
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Mizuta, Satoshi; Shibata, Norio; Akiti, Surendar; Fujimoto, Hiroyuki;
Nakamura, Shuichi; Toru, Takeshi
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Letters (2007), 9(18), 3707-3710

